{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Heki looks at Leaf, and mixes a drink, Vodka, juiced cranberries, triple sec, and a bit of lime.  He pours the red drink in a glass and sets it in front of her.","created_at":"2020-08-19T09:21:58.207000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745573263949824122","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Fat chance. You've already out lived plenty. Including two of my favorite people. Death doesn't happen when we think it ought to. All we can do is live.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T09:23:25.016000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745573628053291070","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
